### Set preferences

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/me/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
"tag_ids": [966, 963, 976],
"source_text": "I enjoy fantasy, mystery, and horror"
}

### Fetch preferences

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/me/preferences

### Replace preferences

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/me/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
"tag_ids": [963],
"source_text": null
}

### Fetch again — should show only mystery

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/me/preferences

### Test invalid tag ID

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/me/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
"tag_ids": [999999],
"source_text": "This should fail"
}

### Fetch again — mystery should still exist

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/me/preferences

### Test duplicate IDs

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/me/preferences
Content-Type: application/json

{
"tag_ids": [963, 963],
"source_text": "Testing duplicates"
}

### Fetch again — should contain only one copy of mystery

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/me/preferences
